                "text": "The /api/login endpoint allows unauthorized access by bypassing authentication checks, enabling unauthorized user sessions.\n\nAn attacker can gain access to user accounts and perform actions on behalf of authenticated users.\n\nImplement proper authentication validation in the /api/login endpoint. Use middleware to enforce session tokens and validate credentials before granting access.",
